IDENTIFICATION DIVISION. PROGRAM-ID. T. ENVIRONMENT DIVISION. INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION. FILE-CONTROL. SELECT F ASSIGN TO 'a'. DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
01 WS-VYBE-I PIC 9(4) VALUE 0. FILE SECTION. FD F. 01 R PIC X. PROCEDURE DIVISION. DECLARATIVES. D SECTION. USE GLOBAL AFTER ERROR ON F. D-PARA. DISPLAY 'G-ERR'.
    ADD 1 TO WS-VYBE-I
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING 'G-ERR' DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    EVALUATE WS-VYBE-I
        WHEN 1
            IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "L-ERR"
                DISPLAY "FAIL at 1 want [L-ERR] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
                MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
                RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
            END-IF
        WHEN OTHER
            DISPLAY "FAIL: more than 1 line(s)"
            MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
            RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-EVALUATE. END DECLARATIVES. M SECTION. CALL 'SUB'. STOP RUN. IDENTIFICATION DIVISION. PROGRAM-ID. SUB. PROCEDURE DIVISION. DECLARATIVES. D SECTION. USE AFTER ERROR ON F. D-PARA. DISPLAY 'L-ERR'.
    ADD 1 TO WS-VYBE-I
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING 'L-ERR' DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    EVALUATE WS-VYBE-I
        WHEN 1
            IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "L-ERR"
                DISPLAY "FAIL at 1 want [L-ERR] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
                MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
                RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
            END-IF
        WHEN OTHER
            DISPLAY "FAIL: more than 1 line(s)"
            MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
            RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-EVALUATE. END DECLARATIVES. S SECTION. OPEN INPUT F. EXIT PROGRAM.     IF WS-VYBE-I NOT = 1
        DISPLAY "FAIL: " WS-VYBE-I " line(s), wanted 1"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
END PROGRAM SUB.
